<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Utico name changes to BATSA from July 21.</title>
<headline>Utico name changes to BATSA from July 21.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African tobacco company Utico Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it would change its name to British American Tobacco Holdings (South Africa) Ltd (BATSA) with effect from July 21.</p>
<p>The reason for the change of name is to associate the company with the name of British American Tobacco, the company's main shareholder.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
